-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7de1787f-7925-436d-87cf-148c11ceffd8" data-turn-start-message="true" dir="auto" tabindex="0" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="144">Yes. I can give you a <strong data-start="22" data-end="45">clickable file link</strong>, but I can't directly host the image on a public website from here. The safest way for IBM Bob is:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="146" data-end="179"><strong data-start="146" data-end="179">1. Download this exact image:</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="181" data-end="282"><button aria-label="Download the dashboard background image" class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline px-1 text-token-text-link font-medium" type="button"><span style="display: inline-block; height: 1lh; margin-inline-end: 3px; position: relative; vertical-align: bottom; width: 16px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="library-file-icon" data-library-file-icon-kind="document" data-library-file-icon-key="photo" class="" style="color: rgb(255, 102, 173); height: 16px; position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 16px;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.113 5.57446C13.4262 5.5745 14.491 6.63918 14.491 7.95239C14.4908 9.26547 13.4261 10.3303 12.113 10.3303C10.8 10.3302 9.73526 9.26544 9.73511 7.95239C9.73511 6.63922 10.7999 5.57455 12.113 5.57446ZM12.113 6.90454C11.5344 6.90463 11.0652 7.37375 11.0652 7.95239C11.0653 8.5309 11.5345 9.00015 12.113 9.00024C12.6916 9.0002 13.1607 8.53093 13.1609 7.95239C13.1609 7.37372 12.6917 6.90458 12.113 6.90454Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M14.1667 2.52173C16.0068 2.52173 17.4988 4.01373 17.4988 5.85376V14.1868C17.4988 16.0268 16.0068 17.5188 14.1667 17.5188H5.83374C3.99371 17.5188 2.50171 16.0268 2.50171 14.1868V5.85376C2.50171 4.01373 3.99371 2.52173 5.83374 2.52173H14.1667ZM5.83374 3.85181C4.72825 3.85181 3.83179 4.74827 3.83179 5.85376V11.9524L5.05249 10.7317C5.96295 9.82123 7.43974 9.82144 8.35034 10.7317L13.8074 16.1887H14.1667C15.2722 16.1887 16.1687 15.2923 16.1687 14.1868V5.85376C16.1687 4.74827 15.2722 3.85181 14.1667 3.85181H5.83374ZM7.40991 11.6721C7.01871 11.2813 6.38399 11.2811 5.99292 11.6721L3.83179 13.8333V14.1868C3.83179 15.2923 4.72825 16.1887 5.83374 16.1887H11.9265L7.40991 11.6721Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span>Download the dashboard background image</button></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="284" data-end="331"><strong data-start="284" data-end="317">2. Put it inside your project</strong>, for example:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="333" data-end="443"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0" style=""><code><span>Loan_Default_Risk_Analytics/
└── dashboard/
    └── assets/
        └── credit_risk_background.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="445" data-end="471">Then give Bob this prompt:</p>
<blockquote data-start="473" data-end="1944">
<p dir="auto" data-start="475" data-end="569"><strong data-start="475" data-end="569">Use the exact image I provided as the background/hero visual for the main <code data-start="551" data-end="556">app</code> home page.</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="574" data-end="646">The image is located at:<br>
<code data-start="601" data-end="646">dashboard/assets/credit_risk_background.png</code></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="651" data-end="764">Do not recreate, redesign, replace, crop unnecessarily, or generate a different image. Use this exact image file.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="l3x4lr" dir="auto" data-start="769" data-end="782">Placement</h3>
<ul data-start="785" data-end="1856">
<li data-section-id="9ffecw" data-start="785" data-end="892">
<p dir="auto" data-start="787" data-end="892">Use it as a professional <strong data-start="812" data-end="838">hero background/banner</strong> on the main Loan Default Risk Analytics landing page.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ztkbt7" data-start="895" data-end="966">
<p dir="auto" data-start="897" data-end="966">Keep the image clearly visible and maintain its original proportions.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ha10vc" data-start="969" data-end="1042">
<p dir="auto" data-start="971" data-end="1042">Add a subtle dark/blue overlay only if necessary to make text readable.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7vuxtr" data-start="1045" data-end="1132">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1047" data-end="1132">Place the project title and subtitle over the image in a clean professional position.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="vdrozd" data-start="1135" data-end="1278">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1137" data-end="1278">Keep the existing KPI cards, navigation, modules, charts, prediction logic, model, dataset loading, and all existing functionality unchanged.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1p8p6od" data-start="1281" data-end="1337">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1283" data-end="1337">Do not modify any backend/model/data-processing logic.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2rqbq0" data-start="1340" data-end="1451">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1342" data-end="1451">Make the design look like a professional <strong data-start="1383" data-end="1450">credit-risk analytics dashboard used by a financial institution</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dduweh" data-start="1454" data-end="1533">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1456" data-end="1533">Ensure the image works correctly both locally and after Streamlit deployment.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19ndjec" data-start="1536" data-end="1656">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1538" data-end="1656">Use a proper relative path such as <code data-start="1573" data-end="1618">dashboard/assets/credit_risk_background.png</code>; do not use an absolute Windows path.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lgnbhj" data-start="1659" data-end="1854">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1661" data-end="1854">If Streamlit requires a different implementation for the background, implement it through the existing centralized <code data-start="1776" data-end="1796">dashboard/theme.py</code> styling rather than duplicating CSS throughout the pages.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1859" data-end="1944"><strong data-start="1859" data-end="1873">Important:</strong> This is a UI-only change. Preserve all existing working functionality.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 data-section-id="zmnjo8" dir="auto" data-start="1946" data-end="1969">One important thing</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1971" data-end="2102">The image you uploaded is only <strong data-start="2002" data-end="2018">472 × 247 px</strong>, so if Bob stretches it across a large hero section, it may become slightly blurry.</p>
